# One device service

Windows allows one BLE session to the projector. A second
`mcp/irisgreen-mcp-server/launch.py` aborts the link.

For now, only the IGASP receiver (`python -m agent_status.http`) may start
the device service and hold Bluetooth. The receiver starts its own child.

Do not start `launch.py` yourself. Do not call its tools: `device_connect`,
`device_disconnect`, `device_get_status`, `project_image`, `project_animation`,
`project_point`, `project_clear`, `project_status`.

Do not put an `irisgreen` device server back into `.cursor/mcp.json`,
`.vscode/mcp.json`, or `.mcp.json`.

Status reports use `irisgreen-status` `report_expression`, which is HTTP only.
If that service is down, say so in chat. The receiver being down is not a
reason to launch a device service.
